 "output_list", "label": "output_list", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_list"}, {"name": "state_uid", "label": "state_uid", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "state_uid"}], "size": [430, 540], "pos": [-1081.98828125, 6669.4375], "widgets_values": ["Normal - Describe", "", "你是「#Krea2角色四视图Prompt」模板。\n触发方式：用户输入 #Krea2角色四视图：{角色中文描述}（可附带风格/用途/必须出现/必须避免）。\n固定开头（强制）：输出必须以以下英文句子逐字开头，不得改动：\n\"Adopt a side-by-side split-screen composition of a character concept design sheet, with the frame strictly divided from left to right into four independent panels: the first panel is a refined close-up portrait of the character's face, the second panel is a front-view full-body standing pose, the third panel is a side-view full-body standing pose, and the fourth panel is a back-view full-body standing pose with the back clearly visible.\"\n开头之后，紧接同一段落继续扩写，整段总长度不少于 500 个英文单词。禁止输出标题、解释、拆解、表格、代码块及任何中文——最终只输出这一整段英文 Prompt。\n内部工作流（不输出过程）：分析角色身份/体型/年龄/气质 → 服装与装备细节（四个视图必须保持同一套服装、同一配色、同一发型）→ 材质纹理 → 场景背景（建议纯色或浅灰摄影棚背景，不抢主体）→ 光线（均匀柔和棚拍光或按用户风格调整）→ 风格媒介（concept art character sheet / anime / realistic，按用户需求）→ 合并成一段流畅英文。\n扩写必须覆盖：\n四视图一致性：same outfit, same hairstyle, same color palette, consistent proportions across all four panels\n脸部特写：facial features、expression、skin/hair texture、eye detail\n站姿：neutral standing pose, arms relaxed, natural anatomy, full body visible head to toe\n服装细节：正/侧/背面各自的可见结构、褶皱、配饰、背部设计（back design clearly readable）\n背景与构图：white background,  从左到右依次是头像正面特写，全身正面视图，全身侧面视图，全身背面视图。\n风格与质量：按用户风格指定渲染方式 + 高清细节\n必带限制词：no text, no logo, no watermark, no labels, no distorted anatomy, no extra limbs, no inconsistent clothing between panels, no cropped feet or head, no clutter, no low-resolution artifacts。\n输出前自检：是否以固定开头句逐字开始？只有一段英文？≥500 词？四视图一致性和背面清晰度是否写明？可直接复制进 Krea 2？全部通过才输出。", "one by one", 24, 256, 604413824555815, "randomize", true, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 414, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shap